# Z InfoTech AI Ltd — Project Rules

- Project: marketing website for Z InfoTech AI Ltd, a UK-registered IT company.
- Stack: Next.js App Router, JavaScript only (.js / .jsx files). Do NOT use TypeScript: no .ts/.tsx files, no type annotations, no tsconfig. Tailwind CSS only. No other UI libraries.
- Pages: Home, About, Services, Portfolio, Contact.
- Design: modern, professional, clean. Dark navy/slate with blue and cyan accents. Inter font via next/font.
- Mobile-first and responsive for phone, tablet, desktop and large screens (sm, md, lg, xl).
- All text content lives in lib/site.js, never hardcoded in pages.
- Use British English.
- Use semantic HTML, accessible labels, alt text, visible focus states.
- Use Server Components by default; "use client" only when needed.
- Work on one task at a time, only edit files the task mentions, and run npm run build after each task and fix errors.
